# Build context cua monorepo.
#
# Cac Dockerfile duoi services/ (ai-suite/ml-worker, ai-suite/api-gateway va
# toan bo service Java) deu duoc build voi context la THU MUC GOC repo, vi
# chung COPY ca libs/ lan services/<ten>/. Khong co file nay thi Docker nen va
# gui toan bo cay thu muc — ~2,9GB, trong do 1,7GB la .venv cua ml-worker va
# 0,5GB node_modules — cho moi lan build, ke ca khi khong co gi doi.
#
# Chi loai cac thu muc san pham/phu thuoc sinh ra tren may local. Khong
# Dockerfile nao COPY tu chung: Java build bang mvn ngay trong image, Node
# chay pnpm install trong image, Python chay poetry install trong image.

.git
.gitignore
.github

# Phu thuoc va san pham build cua tung he sinh thai
**/node_modules
**/target
**/dist
**/build
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info

# Cache cua cong cu
#
# *.tsbuildinfo phai loai, khong phai cho gon ma vi tinh dung: tsconfig cua
# libs/common-node va ai-gateway deu bat `incremental`. Neu file tsbuildinfo
# cua may local lot vao image trong khi dist/ da bi loai, tsc doi chieu thay
# "khong co gi doi" va BO QUA buoc sinh ma — dist/ trong image chi co .d.ts,
# thieu gan het .js, va container chet voi
# 'Cannot find module .../common-node/dist/index.js'. Da dinh that mot lan.
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.mypy_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/.next

# Bi mat va log — KHONG BAO GIO dua vao image
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.log
.local-logs

# Thu muc lam viec cua may local
.claude
.idea
.vscode
**/.DS_Store

# Tai lieu, so tay, ha tang — khong service nao can luc chay
docs
notebooks
**/notebooks
infrastructure/monitoring
infrastructure/k8s-manifests
infrastructure/helm
infrastructure/terraform
infrastructure/argocd

# Test: chay o CI chu khong dong goi vao image runtime
**/tests
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.test.ts
